        {
          "id": "hangzhou-note",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Every time I visit, I'm amazed at how much this city has changed - in a way, Hangzhou is my first-hand experience feeling the country's dramatic urbanization over decades. But there are some things that never change - afternoon strolls around West Lake and some really awesome homemade dumplings.",
